displacement while invisible is the better combination over protection
and invisible. The displacement guarantees a miss (for the monster) on
the first hit, even for those who have see invisible. It seems to me,
that, once the monster has located you (fighting next to each other),
the monster hits you normally as  if you weren't invisible, despite
your  intrinsic. However should you have  the displacement, the following
hits are severely impaired.

Thus, a gray dragon scale  mail, shield of reflection, cloak of displacement,
a helm  of telepathy, and speed boots, make a generally good combination of
armour to wear.

frog.


